==Battleground==
*1 [[Battle Balloon (Enemy)|Battle Balloon]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Castle Horseman (Enemy)|Castle Horseman]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Castle Horseman (Enemy)|Castle Horseman]] spawns after 28.67 seconds<sup>860f</sup>.
*1 [[Castle Horseman (Enemy)|Castle Horseman]] spawns after 30.67 seconds<sup>920f</sup>.
*1 [[Castle Horseman (Enemy)|Castle Horseman]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Castle Horseman (Enemy)|Castle Horseman]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Battle Balloon (Enemy)|Battle Balloon]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Castle Horseman (Enemy)|Castle Horsemen]] spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
**5 [[Ashura (Enemy)|Ashuras]] spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**1 [[Golem (Enemy)|Golem]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Pretty Cat (Enemy)|Pretty Cats]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Pretty Cat (Enemy)|Pretty Cats]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Battle Balloon (Enemy)|Battle Balloons]] spawn, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A rather hard stage to beat since all enemies are at a high magnification, with Golem, the biggest threat, having 450,000 HP. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] can help deal with it while any other high DPS units can deal with the other enemies.

